{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52430","headline":"回波乐 七十三 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 七十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"父母生儿身，衣食养儿德。\n蹔托寄出来，欲似相便贷。\n儿大作兵夫，西征吐蕃贼。\n行後浑家死，廻来觅不得。\n儿身面向南，死者头向北。\n父子相分擘，不及元不识。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52430.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52430","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}